#[doc("""
Single-dispatch protocols, lowered before the resolver.
`lower_protocols` expands each `#[derive(P)]` into an `impl`, checks the
impls against their protocols, lowers every impl method to an ordinary
function and emits one dispatcher per protocol operation. After
inference, the impl a call's argument heads select is found here too,
and a call no impl serves is reported. Named `protos`, not `protocols`:
a module binds its last dotted segment, and `protocols` is the stdlib
core module.
""")]

